舎から来たばかりで右も左も分からない子なのだと、懸命に世話を焼こうとする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家は有名な音楽家の一族で、本人もピアノはセミプロ並の腕。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"197733"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/49/498fe815cd6cdbce86f43717f2c750eb116c4da8924f20d48e7f7c0689add351.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b8/b821da247012f1ab943b50f5dd66b0bba78cfd34f455f177d02d860a2a01a071.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"加藤雅美","creatorId":"vndb:s656","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s656","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s656","name":"加藤 雅美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:10952:197733:13773:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c5611","characterName":"椿原 蓮","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"11482","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"10952"}],"egsCharacterIds":["21133"],"vndbCharacterId":"c5611"},"originalCharacterName":"椿原 蓮","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"8月16日"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"161"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"セント・テレジア学院二年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"国家議員の一人娘。主人公のクラスメイト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"全校の運動部を一手に引き受ける運動神経抜群の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の“オスカル”的存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"正義感の強い、さっぱりとしていて真っ直ぐな性格。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21133","sourceWorkId":"8974","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"一手包揽全校运动部的超级运动神经少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学园的奥斯卡大人指的就是她。与修史在同一班级。"},{"spoiler":false,