妖精のよう……と上級生に大人気。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"鞠奈とは同じクラスで、その明るい性格から皆に好かれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は運動神経抜群で、時折、周囲を驚かせることがある。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"197732"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7d/7d4e77d326c43f6b51b60a470db260480780cfa8d8dcda7b5537a58b9cc47e77.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/eb/ebb0846613fed8ce75132c58fcbe23cfe9f392a93b652efab36bcb2257e221de.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"永田佳代","creatorId":"vndb:s266","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s266","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s266","name":"永田 佳代","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:10952:197732:6038:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"夏野 こおり","creatorId":"vndb:s5","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5","name":"田口 宏子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:3806","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c5614","characterName":"春日崎 雪乃","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"11481","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"10952"}],"egsCharacterIds":["21132"],"vndbCharacterId":"c5614"},"originalCharacterName":"春日崎 雪乃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"12月1日"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"163"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"セント・テレジア学院三年生。学園の学生会長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"春日崎財閥の令嬢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"全校女学生の憧れの的で、“お姉さま”といえば彼女のこと。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は面倒見がよく、責任感が強いものの、自信家で、高飛車な上に高圧的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公を田舎出身の少女と思い込み、この学園から巣立つレディに相応しい人物に育てるのが義務だと勝手に考えているようだ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21132","sourceWorkId":"8974","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"作为学园的学生会长被全校女生憧憬着。说到姐姐大人指的就是她。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽然生着很会照顾人、责任感的性格，但非常高傲又高压。时常充满着自信。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"把主人公当作什么都不懂的乡下少女来看待，因而以把他培养成名副其实的能从该学园毕业的女士作为赋予自己的义务，擅自如此考虑着。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"春日崎财阀的大小姐。兴趣是红茶和读书。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11481"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/afa2b4bcb413c8b803ab83808bc311bda0dee01c375cd99a1be6122d99fab401.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f3/f318ca981a9e0f0ab46fd06a3bb87f8c4adedc8e7987660fcfae830fd8172d66.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"友永朱音","creatorId":"vndb:s83","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s83","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s83","name":"友永 朱音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:10952:11481:4432:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c5616","characterName":"穂村 有里","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"11484","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"10952"}],"egsCharacterIds":["21136"],"vndbCharacterId":"c5616"},"originalCharacterName":"穂村 有里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"10月10日"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"159"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"セント・テレジア学院二年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とは違う組織から送り込まれてきたエージェント。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"戦闘能力はあまり高くないが、潜入能力と情報収集能力に優れ、連絡員的な役割を担うことが多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人懐っこい性格ながら、キレると手が付けれないほど恐ろしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の正体を知っており、主人公にコンプレックスを抱いているようだ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21136","sourceWorkId":"8974","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"与主人公不同的、从别处组织送来的精英。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"战斗能力・护卫能力完全不高，但潜入能力和情报收集能力优秀，因而经常作为联络员而活跃。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公的真实身份，也已在事前入手的情报中得知。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"待人友善的性格和表里如一的言行使得其深受周围喜爱，但大脑断线后比谁都可怕。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"内心对主人公怀着自卑感，偶尔与主人公对抗时也……"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"没有兴趣爱好，但最近陷入减肥困扰之中。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11484"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ff/ff56e2b863b7f05a8f6aa9ef9b07614333e7ef6078d27a7d61dce9e24744841a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0d/0d5403a96a4c6c30d241dd6f90ca74abf1a36d4b9e7a475eb154951567d7ad5c.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"吉田愛理","creatorId":"vndb:s757","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s757","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s757","name":"吉田 愛理","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:10952:11484:6037:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c5617","characterName":"シスター・リディア","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"11486","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"10952"}],"egsCharacterIds":["21139"],"vndbCharacterId":"c5617"},"originalCharacterName":"シスター・リディア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"教会から学園に派遣されてきたイタリア人のシスター。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どんなときでも笑顔を絶やさず、慈愛に満ちた優しさを持つ彼女の元に